          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Tabomo",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nebthun",
            text: _("Kai Krellis! You live! We thought you and your people had all been killed when Jotha fell."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("No, most of us escaped. I thought your settlements might be far enough away to escape harm, but you look as if you had seen battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nebthun",
            text: _("Indeed, though we have not been hard-pressed. The creatures have been busy fouling the waters and making the bay more to their liking. We worry that they will soon be back to finish with us, and I fear we will not survive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("We come prepared for battle, and have brought help. We will reclaim our home and make yours safe as well. Mal-Ravanal will pay this day."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nebthun",
            text: _("Good. We will join you. You will be impressed with how quickly Tabomo here crushes skeletons. I think we should make the ruined castle on the mainland our base. The undead cut down many trees there to make bridges, and it is much easier to move through now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_unit_hidden",
            hidden: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Kai Krellis",
